//  Signals/alerts removed — this is a pure visualization indicator.
//  To re-add later: gate entries on `trend` ("up"/"down") plus an OB/FVG
//  zone tap, with structural SL + R:R target. (The old longEdge/shortEdge
//  tap-feed and frozen-range equilibrium were removed in this cleanup.)
